            "answer": 9
          },
          {
            "pre": "3x × 2 = ",
            "say": "Now the two cross terms. Outer:",
            "hint": "3 times 2.",
            "post": "x",
            "answer": 6
          },
          {
            "pre": "Inner: 2 × 3x = ",
            "hint": "2 times 3.",
            "post": "x",
            "answer": 6
          },
          {
            "pre": "6x + 6x = ",
            "say": "Add the two cross terms for the middle:",
            "hint": "Add the coefficients: 6 + 6.",
            "post": "x",
            "answer": 12
          },
          {
            "pre": "Last: 2 × 2 = ",
            "hint": "2 times 2.",
            "post": "",
            "answer": 4
          },
          {
            "pre": "And your answer: 9 + 12 + 4 = ",
            "say": "So \\((3x + 2)^2 = 9x^2 + 12x + 4\\). Check with \\(x = 1\\): the bracket is \\(5^2 = 25\\).",
